text = "Counter Guard is primarily a tempo and attack enhancer that also blocks incoming damage by consuming Energy. 

Depleting Energy disables Counter Guard until the bar refills.

Activation: When facing enemy attacks, execute Counter Guard (indicated by a brief yellow \"shine\" effect around the player).

 Importance: Essential for fast-paced gameplay and survival. Precise timing provides:

- Weapon cooldown reduction
- Reduced Energy consumption
- Heat reduction"
autowrap_mode = 3

