text = "Heat is generated by all attacks. The Heat Meter (right side of HUD) shows current and max heat capacity.

Overheat State: Filling the meter triggers temporary overheat with severe penalties:

- Movement speed drastically decreased
- Counter Guard disabled
- Vulcan machine gun slowed
- Damage output halved
- O.D. Mode activation disabled

Heat Management: 
Reduce accumulated heat by:

- Not attacking (heat auto-reduces slowly)
- Shield Guarding (reduction based on grade)
- Health pickups (restore health and reduce heat)"
autowrap_mode = 3

