text = "Health is the mech's functionality state, shown by the large red bar (upper left HUD). 

- Reaching zero ends the game. 
- Restore health via crates occasionally dropped by defeated enemies.

Energy powers Counter Guard activation. Each successful Counter Guard drains energy, shown by the yellow bar below health. 

- Depleting energy temporarily disables Counter Guard until the bar refills."
