text = "Overdrive Mode (O.D. Mode) is a brief activation that grants super abilities:

- Time slows down (enemy movements and attacks)
- Vulcan damage doubles
- Crit rate increases
- Damage taken reduces
- Weapon cooldowns reduce
- Heat completely dissipates

Activation: Fill the momentum meter (left side of HUD) by finishing enemies with cooldown weapons (Vulcan doesn't build momentum).
Tiers: O.D. Mode has 3 levels (1, 2, and Max) based on meter fill. Each level increases:

- O.D. Mode duration
- Vulcan damage multiplier
- Score multiplier
- Cooldown reduction amount"
autowrap_mode = 3

