theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 10
text = "Waves are timed micro-challenges the player must complete to win. Combat is divided into 3 level each containing 5 combat waves and 1 challenge wave.

Combat waves spawn enemy groups to defeat. Beat them before the timer expires to earn extra time and healing. If time runs out, enemies despawn and you take damage (WIP).

Challenge waves are brief skill tests requiring players to reach a threshold count (e.g., \"Do X 10 times\"). Completion grants 2 random stat buffs that persist through the combat scenario."
autowrap_mode = 3

